      "id": "854afde9-d271-4e97-8489-5784ad84bde4-feb27",
      "timestamp": 1772226900000,
      "title": "Second Brain Intelligent Sync Task Execution - February 27, 2026",
      "summary": "Scheduled cron job execution for the Second Brain Intelligent Sync Task. This automated task performs comprehensive synchronization of conversation data into the knowledge management system. Key activities include: analyzing raw conversation data sources, extracting topic tags (second-brain, cron-jobs, intelligent-sync, knowledge-management, system-maintenance, automation, scheduled-task), generating English-only summaries, updating knowledge database and content files, performing system health checks, and ensuring frontend accessibility and API functionality. The task runs periodically to maintain an up-to-date second brain knowledge repository.",
      "topics": ["second-brain", "cron-jobs", "intelligent-sync", "knowledge-management", "system-maintenance", "automation", "scheduled-task"],
      "content_type": "system_task",
